WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.250
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:06.520 --> 00:07.880
Dear gods,

3
00:08.360 --> 00:09.520
my rival and I

4
00:09.600 --> 00:11.120
are joining the same production.

5
00:11.440 --> 00:13.280
This is no small matter.

6
00:13.880 --> 00:15.280
Please show me the way.

7
00:20.400 --> 00:21.400
Master,

8
00:21.920 --> 00:23.040
what does this mean?

9
00:24.600 --> 00:25.840
Over the next three months,

10
00:25.880 --> 00:27.160
you and your rival

11
00:27.480 --> 00:29.600
will unleash a bloody storm.

12
00:31.240 --> 00:32.880
Tell me something I don't know.

13
00:33.320 --> 00:34.320
Would you?

14
00:35.360 --> 00:36.440
What did Master Purple say?

15
00:37.720 --> 00:38.320
Here it is.

16
00:38.321 --> 00:39.439
I'll be as direct,

17
00:39.440 --> 00:40.240
as candid,

18
00:40.241 --> 00:41.439
and as straightforward as possible.

19
00:41.440 --> 00:42.440
Get to the point.

20
00:44.640 --> 00:47.559
Your unequal relationship breeds pain and tension.

21
00:47.560 --> 00:48.919
Keep this up, and you'll both get hurt.

22
00:48.920 --> 00:50.599
To break the deadlock, always be honest.

23
00:50.600 --> 00:51.480
Don't try too hard.

24
00:51.481 --> 00:54.320
Do little things without expecting a reward.

25
00:54.560 --> 00:55.879
Little things?

26
00:55.880 --> 00:56.880
That's it?

27
00:57.240 --> 00:58.960
Can you really trust online fortune-telling?

28
00:59.720 --> 01:00.960
What did Master Red say?

29
01:08.520 --> 01:09.520
Master Red said...

30
01:10.200 --> 01:11.200
He said...

31
01:11.920 --> 01:12.920
Master,

32
01:13.720 --> 01:15.336
can it get worse than mutual destruction?

33
01:15.360 --> 01:16.360
Just tell me.

34
01:17.640 --> 01:18.720
I can take it.

35
01:19.280 --> 01:20.320
Master Red said

36
01:21.600 --> 01:22.600
you two

37
01:22.720 --> 01:23.720
could get married.

38
02:00.000 --> 02:01.800
"My Rival and Me"

39
02:01.900 --> 02:03.100
(Episode 1)

40
02:09.480 --> 02:09.960
Yiliang,

41
02:09.961 --> 02:11.480
on this production,

42
02:11.920 --> 02:14.760
let's avoid any publicity involving Wei Yanzi.

43
02:15.160 --> 02:16.400
The fan club's biggest accounts

44
02:16.480 --> 02:18.480
all say Wei Yanzi is devious.

45
02:18.680 --> 02:20.880
Better safe than sorry.

46
02:25.000 --> 02:25.720
We got here first.

47
02:25.920 --> 02:26.920
Ignore him. Pull in.

48
02:29.000 --> 02:30.000
Stop.

49
02:31.720 --> 02:32.840
Why did we stop?

50
02:40.880 --> 02:41.880
You take it.

51
02:41.960 --> 02:42.960
We'll find another spot.

52
02:43.280 --> 02:44.360
Let's go, driver.

53
02:47.160 --> 02:48.560
Wei Yanzi?

54
02:49.520 --> 02:51.080
Since when is he so nice?

55
02:51.360 --> 02:52.880
Don't assume the worst of people.

56
02:53.200 --> 02:54.600
I don't get it.

57
02:54.920 --> 02:56.000
One good deed a day.

58
02:56.320 --> 02:58.480
Remember Master Purple's advice.

59
02:58.720 --> 02:59.800
Never forget it.

60
03:00.240 --> 03:01.360
Beware of bloodshed.

61
03:02.760 --> 03:03.480
You're a real saint.

62
03:03.481 --> 03:04.640
Of course.

63
03:10.240 --> 03:11.240
Damn!

64
03:11.640 --> 03:12.640
What happened?

65
03:13.360 --> 03:14.760
We've got a flat.

66
03:16.200 --> 03:17.720
I knew he did it on purpose.

67
03:40.080 --> 03:41.960
The nearest parking is 500 meters away.

68
03:44.160 --> 03:45.160
Filming comes first.

69
03:45.161 --> 03:46.600
We'll sort out parking later.

70
03:50.920 --> 03:52.919
We've already cast Chu Feng.

71
03:52.920 --> 03:54.440
And it's definitely not you.

72
04:01.760 --> 04:03.800
Stop blocking the way. It's annoying.

73
04:33.320 --> 04:34.400
Where's my bike?

74
04:39.920 --> 04:41.000
He's pretty fast.

75
04:41.200 --> 04:42.360
Screw you!

76
05:08.003 --> 05:09.936
["Add to block list"]

77
05:16.920 --> 05:18.760
Our director will now offer incense.

78
05:21.440 --> 05:22.480
Wei!

79
05:22.600 --> 05:24.879
The spot you gave Mr. Gu gave him a flat.

80
05:24.880 --> 05:25.880
What?

81
05:27.560 --> 05:28.200
Are you sure?

82
05:28.320 --> 05:28.960
Positive.

83
05:28.961 --> 05:30.440
That was Gu Yiliang's car?

84
05:32.600 --> 05:33.600
I'm doomed.

85
05:34.280 --> 05:35.280
It's only the first day,

86
05:35.880 --> 05:37.520
and I've already offended my rival.

87
05:39.440 --> 05:40.480
It's fine.

88
05:40.680 --> 05:41.680
Gu Yiliang

89
05:42.160 --> 05:44.120
won't think I did it on purpose.

90
05:50.120 --> 05:51.680
I'm sure he'll forgive me.

91
05:55.600 --> 05:57.320
A terrible omen.

92
05:57.880 --> 05:59.520
Mr. Wei Yanzi, please offer incense.

93
06:09.960 --> 06:10.960
It's all right.

94
06:11.200 --> 06:13.640
It's all right.

95
06:21.320 --> 06:22.320
It's fine.

96
06:22.800 --> 06:23.880
No, no.

97
06:24.400 --> 06:25.520
I need to apologize properly

98
06:25.800 --> 06:26.840
to make this right.

99
06:29.400 --> 06:31.799
Glad you're here. We're short on time. Read the script?

100
06:31.800 --> 06:32.720
I have.

101
06:32.721 --> 06:34.240
Good. I have faith in you.

102
06:34.600 --> 06:35.680
I'll head to the set, then.

103
06:37.600 --> 06:38.800
Mr. Gu Yiliang,

104
06:44.920 --> 06:45.920
I'm sorry.

105
06:48.400 --> 06:49.680
About the flat tire...

106
06:49.920 --> 06:50.920
I'm sorry.

107
06:51.480 --> 06:52.480
All right.

108
06:52.720 --> 06:53.360
Get up first.

109
06:53.361 --> 06:54.400
I won't get up

110
06:54.480 --> 06:55.360
until you forgive me.

111
06:55.480 --> 06:56.480
I'm sorry. Sor...

112
06:58.160 --> 06:59.160
What happened?

113
07:00.000 --> 07:01.200
It's stuck! My hair's caught!

114
07:01.800 --> 07:02.960
I'm sorry, Mr. Gu Yiliang.

115
07:03.080 --> 07:04.080
I'm so sorry.

116
07:04.160 --> 07:04.640
I'm sorry.

117
07:05.040 --> 07:06.000
Hair and makeup!

118
07:06.040 --> 07:07.680
If only certain people

119
07:07.840 --> 07:10.120
acted this much on camera.

120
07:10.640 --> 07:11.880
Some people's acting skills

121
07:12.000 --> 07:13.999
all go into playing innocent.

122
07:14.000 --> 07:14.640
Who do you mean?

123
07:14.640 --> 07:15.320
You.

124
07:15.320 --> 07:15.960
What do you mean?

125
07:15.960 --> 07:16.960
Keep your idol in line.

126
07:35.240 --> 07:38.040
We just started. Why all these scandals already?

127
07:38.320 --> 07:39.320
Wei,

128
07:39.480 --> 07:40.240
stop searching.

129
07:40.440 --> 07:41.736
Reading dirt about yourself all day

130
07:41.760 --> 07:42.760
must be depressing.

131
07:45.840 --> 07:48.200
Why not search your rival's name

132
07:48.480 --> 07:49.720
and read the dirt on him?

133
07:49.800 --> 07:51.160
It might cheer you up.

134
07:52.880 --> 07:54.760
You have a point, kid.

135
07:57.320 --> 07:59.760
Gu Yiliang.

136
08:04.240 --> 08:05.240
Xiao Chen,

137
08:05.320 --> 08:07.520
it's all praise!

138
08:12.080 --> 08:15.200
Comparison really is the thief of joy.

139
08:18.760 --> 08:19.760
What's this?

140
08:20.360 --> 08:21.480
A matchmaking ad?

141
09:11.000 --> 09:12.000
Xiao Chen,

142
09:12.800 --> 09:14.280
I think I've discovered a wonderful

143
09:14.800 --> 09:16.240
and deeply bizarre new world.

144
09:18.720 --> 09:20.480
This rivalry is so intense

145
09:21.320 --> 09:22.400
that the dirt on Gu Yiliang

146
09:22.480 --> 09:24.240
has broken Wei's brain.

147
09:25.000 --> 09:26.480
I haven't quite grasped its essence.

148
09:26.560 --> 09:27.560
Let me take another look.

149
09:36.200 --> 09:37.080
Xiao Chen, come on.

150
09:37.080 --> 09:37.840
Time to work.

151
09:37.840 --> 09:38.840
Come on, Chen.

152
09:39.360 --> 09:40.360
Your phone.

153
09:54.200 --> 09:55.200
Brother,

154
09:55.360 --> 09:56.360
our duel today

155
09:56.720 --> 09:57.920
isn't about winning or losing.

156
09:58.000 --> 09:58.760
It's a friendly exchange.

157
09:58.760 --> 09:59.760
Cut!

158
10:00.560 --> 10:02.480
Wei, where's your conviction?

159
10:03.040 --> 10:04.759
You have to become this character.

160
10:04.760 --> 10:05.760
You understand?

161
10:05.840 --> 10:06.520
Sorry, Director Lu.

162
10:06.521 --> 10:07.961
I'll find that conviction right now.

163
10:09.760 --> 10:12.800
Conviction...

164
10:13.040 --> 10:14.119
Where are you, conviction?

165
10:14.120 --> 10:14.600
Come find me!

166
10:14.600 --> 10:15.280
Ready, Wei?

167
10:15.400 --> 10:16.400
Thank you.

168
10:17.440 --> 10:18.720
Ready, Director Lu. Let's do it.

169
10:20.640 --> 10:22.280
Bamboo grove, shot one, take two.

170
10:22.560 --> 10:24.240
Three, two, one.

171
10:24.360 --> 10:25.360
Action!

172
10:27.400 --> 10:28.400
Brother,

173
10:28.560 --> 10:29.560
our duel today

174
10:30.200 --> 10:31.200
is not to win or lose.

175
10:31.240 --> 10:32.759
It's a friendly exchange of skills.

176
10:32.760 --> 10:33.760
Cut!

177
10:34.440 --> 10:35.000
Wei,

178
10:35.040 --> 10:36.159
are you looking at an enemy

179
10:36.160 --> 10:37.160
or your brother?

180
10:41.440 --> 10:42.560
Brother,

181
10:42.800 --> 10:44.400
our duel today...

182
10:44.600 --> 10:45.600
- Isn't... - Cut!

183
10:46.040 --> 10:46.960
It's broad daylight.

184
10:47.000 --> 10:48.280
Stop flirting with your brother.

185
10:49.200 --> 10:50.200
Brother,

186
10:50.880 --> 10:51.880
our duel today...

187
10:52.000 --> 10:53.000
Cut!

188
10:53.040 --> 10:54.560
And you definitely can't fall for him!

189
10:55.240 --> 10:56.240
Come here.

190
10:56.440 --> 10:56.840
Stop.

191
10:57.400 --> 10:58.400
Everyone, take a break.

192
11:03.560 --> 11:04.200
Wei Yanzi,

193
11:04.480 --> 11:05.920
let me explain the scene again.

194
11:06.560 --> 11:09.040
You need to understand this character.

195
11:09.160 --> 11:12.120
Get into his background and relationships.

196
11:13.440 --> 11:16.080
They debuted at the same company together.

197
11:16.240 --> 11:17.680
How can one be in the heavens

198
11:17.800 --> 11:19.600
and the other 20,000 leagues under the sea?

199
11:19.960 --> 11:22.280
Don't let the rumors affect you.

200
11:22.440 --> 11:23.679
Your feelings for your brother

201
11:23.680 --> 11:24.800
are conflicted.

202
11:25.000 --> 11:25.720
You respect him,

203
11:25.920 --> 11:27.199
but you want to defeat him.

204
11:27.200 --> 11:28.960
Do you understand?

205
11:29.080 --> 11:30.120
Yes, Director.

206
11:30.320 --> 11:31.519
Good. Shall we try again?

207
11:31.520 --> 11:32.520
Yes.

208
11:32.720 --> 11:33.720
Everyone in position.

209
11:34.040 --> 11:35.040
Let's go again.

210
11:38.920 --> 11:39.560
Bamboo grove.

211
11:39.680 --> 11:40.680
Shot one, take five.

212
11:48.320 --> 11:49.320
Brother,

213
11:50.120 --> 11:51.120
our duel today

214
11:51.360 --> 11:52.720
isn't about winning or losing.

215
11:53.320 --> 11:54.720
It's a friendly exchange of skills.

216
11:56.000 --> 11:57.440
Whatever others may say,

217
11:58.440 --> 12:00.600
it won't affect our bond as brothers.

218
12:05.600 --> 12:06.600
Let's begin.

219
12:20.920 --> 12:22.040
Hey, careful!

220
12:22.800 --> 12:24.959
Mr. Gu, are you all right?

221
12:24.960 --> 12:27.160
Are you okay?

222
12:27.200 --> 12:28.760
Wei Yanzi pushed Her Majesty over!

223
12:28.960 --> 12:30.719
Your Gu Yiliang fell down himself

224
12:30.720 --> 12:31.600
and dragged our Yanzi down!

225
12:31.601 --> 12:33.080
Oh, please, girl!

226
12:33.280 --> 12:34.280
Who dragged whom?

227
12:34.400 --> 12:35.960
Everyone knows your idol

228
12:36.000 --> 12:36.920
is an attention-seeking nobody!

229
12:36.920 --> 12:37.680
Say that again!

230
12:37.680 --> 12:38.600
Say it again on camera!

231
12:38.600 --> 12:39.480
Didn't hear me the first time?

232
12:39.481 --> 12:40.840
Everyone knows your idol...

233
12:41.200 --> 12:42.200
Girls! Girls!

234
12:42.200 --> 12:43.200
Stop fighting!

235
12:43.240 --> 12:45.120
May our boys live happily ever after!

236
12:45.680 --> 12:46.680
What?

237
12:48.200 --> 12:51.280
As friends! Friends forever!

238
12:51.400 --> 12:52.280
Who are you?

239
12:52.360 --> 12:53.080
Who do you think you are?

240
12:53.080 --> 12:53.480
Listen,

241
12:53.481 --> 12:54.960
your idol's the fake innocent one!

242
12:59.560 --> 13:01.480
Master Purple is frighteningly accurate.

243
13:01.960 --> 13:04.520
All roads lead to the occult.

244
13:05.240 --> 13:07.080
Gu Yiliang just joined the cast,

245
13:07.440 --> 13:09.880
and sharing a frame with me brings him bad luck.

246
13:10.720 --> 13:12.800
Am I really his jinx?

247
13:19.080 --> 13:21.880
One is a brilliant, aloof academic.

248
13:22.200 --> 13:24.920
The other, a reckless rich playboy.

249
13:25.400 --> 13:27.240
Their paths should never have crossed,

250
13:27.480 --> 13:29.120
but the moment they met,

251
13:29.280 --> 13:31.080
fate struck an unexpected chord.

252
13:34.680 --> 13:36.320
What a melodramatic

253
13:36.640 --> 13:39.200
yet beautiful love story!

254
13:41.920 --> 13:42.920
Come in.

255
13:44.280 --> 13:46.520
He came for you.

256
13:51.240 --> 13:52.480
Mr. Gu!

257
13:56.280 --> 13:57.280
Mr. Gu!

258
13:57.400 --> 13:58.560
Mr. Gu!

259
13:59.160 --> 14:00.000
Hello, Mr. Gu.

260
14:00.080 --> 14:01.320
Just call me Gu Yiliang.

261
14:02.120 --> 14:03.160
Mr... Mr. Gu.

262
14:03.680 --> 14:05.280
Sorry about earlier.

263
14:05.880 --> 14:07.319
We have a lot of scenes together.

264
14:07.320 --> 14:08.959
Let's rehearse when we're free.

265
14:08.960 --> 14:09.960
Sure.

266
14:10.400 --> 14:12.360
That's what I came to discuss.

267
14:12.520 --> 14:13.520
If we rehearse more,

268
14:13.600 --> 14:14.840
we'll develop better chemistry.

269
14:15.720 --> 14:17.919
My rival caught me watching a ship video of us.

270
14:17.920 --> 14:19.880
Could this get any more awkward?

271
14:20.040 --> 14:21.040
Have you eaten?

272
14:21.240 --> 14:21.680
Not yet.

273
14:21.681 --> 14:22.801
Want something to eat, then?

274
14:22.840 --> 14:23.960
Wei!

275
14:24.440 --> 14:25.440
Here.

276
14:26.720 --> 14:27.759
Wei, my ass!

277
14:27.760 --> 14:29.079
Chen Youyuan, why come back now of all times?

278
14:29.080 --> 14:29.920
Get out of here!

279
14:29.920 --> 14:30.280
Out!

280
14:30.281 --> 14:31.520
I wish I could leave too.

281
14:31.640 --> 14:32.280
Mr. Gu.

282
14:32.360 --> 14:33.679
Oh, hello.

283
14:33.680 --> 14:34.680
Hello.

284
14:35.600 --> 14:36.280
Filming starts soon.

285
14:36.281 --> 14:37.999
Want some milk tea to tide you over?

286
14:38.000 --> 14:40.040
You hate sweet drinks. Please say no.

287
14:40.560 --> 14:41.560
Sure.

288
14:50.040 --> 14:51.200
Only one cup?

289
14:52.720 --> 14:53.200
Yeah.

290
14:53.520 --> 14:54.360
How about...

291
14:54.520 --> 14:55.520
You leave.

292
14:55.800 --> 14:57.040
How about we share?

293
14:57.880 --> 14:58.600
Got a spoon?

294
14:58.640 --> 14:59.200
I don't think so.

295
14:59.280 --> 15:00.280
Yes, I do!

296
15:01.920 --> 15:02.920
Here.

297
15:03.000 --> 15:04.520
What would you like to add?

298
15:04.640 --> 15:05.640
Your WeChat.

299
15:09.920 --> 15:11.440
Oh, my stomach suddenly hurts.

300
15:11.480 --> 15:12.480
I'll leave you to it.

301
15:16.280 --> 15:17.520
I forgot to add you before.

302
15:17.560 --> 15:18.200
Sorry.

303
15:18.201 --> 15:19.519
No worries.

304
15:19.520 --> 15:20.400
Let me scan your code.

305
15:20.400 --> 15:21.400
I'll scan yours.

306
15:21.440 --> 15:21.760
Here.

307
15:21.760 --> 15:22.080
That works.

308
15:22.280 --> 15:23.280
Here.

309
15:29.760 --> 15:31.360
That costume looks good on you.

310
15:31.960 --> 15:32.880
Blue-gray really suits you.

311
15:32.960 --> 15:34.119
Your costume looks great too.

312
15:34.120 --> 15:35.280
Brick red suits me?

313
15:38.720 --> 15:40.360
Is it that funny?

314
15:41.760 --> 15:42.760
I never realized

315
15:42.840 --> 15:43.840
you were so amusing.

316
15:44.040 --> 15:46.200
You just lack an eye for beauty.

317
15:46.400 --> 15:48.440
Chen Youyuan, I was wrong.

318
15:48.480 --> 15:51.440
Come back!

319
15:58.200 --> 15:58.840
Excuse me.

320
15:59.200 --> 15:59.760
Hello.

321
15:59.840 --> 16:00.840
Have you seen Wei?

322
16:03.880 --> 16:04.880
Miss?

323
16:05.160 --> 16:06.240
Where did Wei go?

324
16:06.440 --> 16:07.440
He left ages ago.

325
16:08.280 --> 16:09.280
Left?

326
16:09.360 --> 16:10.360
I'm still here.

327
16:10.400 --> 16:11.400
Where could he go?

328
16:15.320 --> 16:16.320
Miss,

329
16:16.560 --> 16:17.560
I'm still here.

330
16:17.640 --> 16:18.800
Where could he possibly go?

331
16:20.520 --> 16:21.719
Miss! Miss!

332
16:21.720 --> 16:22.280
He left in a hurry.

333
16:22.281 --> 16:23.399
He's off to a class.

334
16:23.400 --> 16:23.920
No way.

335
16:23.960 --> 16:25.280
He's not that keen on studying.

336
16:28.280 --> 16:30.279
Only today did I learn

337
16:30.280 --> 16:33.319
that while the internet dissects our alleged backstabbing

338
16:33.320 --> 16:36.239
and invents reasons for our supposed feud,

339
16:36.240 --> 16:39.959
debating hatred that never existed,

340
16:39.960 --> 16:41.959
there is a group of people

341
16:41.960 --> 16:43.999
who firmly believe

342
16:44.000 --> 16:46.839
that my rival and I share

343
16:46.840 --> 16:51.080
a love never captured or confirmed.

344
16:52.400 --> 16:53.440
You're late.

345
16:53.480 --> 16:54.640
Come sit in the front row.

346
16:54.880 --> 16:55.880
Yes, ma'am.

347
16:59.440 --> 17:00.520
To our new students,

348
17:00.560 --> 17:01.560
welcome!

349
17:01.840 --> 17:04.000
I'm your professor of ship chemistry

350
17:04.200 --> 17:06.360
and the moderator of the Niangzi fan community.

351
17:06.440 --> 17:07.680
Lovely to meet you all.

352
17:08.080 --> 17:09.840
Today's lesson

353
17:09.960 --> 17:11.720
is absolutely crucial.

354
17:11.880 --> 17:12.936
What wasn't on last year's exam

355
17:12.960 --> 17:14.296
will definitely be on this year's.

356
17:14.320 --> 17:16.040
Please take notes.

357
17:16.400 --> 17:17.920
These people on the slide

358
17:18.080 --> 17:19.760
are our Niangzi ship's

359
17:19.880 --> 17:21.640
finest creators.

360
17:21.920 --> 17:24.040
When our boys don't appear together,

361
17:24.200 --> 17:27.200
these creators work purely out of love

362
17:27.280 --> 17:28.720
to keep us fed.

363
17:30.680 --> 17:31.680
The Found-Phone Forum AU.

364
17:31.680 --> 17:32.640
A Hundred Ship Questions.

365
17:32.640 --> 17:33.400
ABO and Hanahaki Disease.

366
17:33.401 --> 17:34.481
Fake Lovers, Growing Pains.

367
17:34.640 --> 17:36.640
And The Room You Can't Leave Without Doing XX.

368
17:37.960 --> 17:39.320
All these stories

369
17:39.760 --> 17:41.120
are about me and Gu Yiliang.

370
17:43.040 --> 17:44.080
But Gu Yiliang and I

371
17:44.120 --> 17:45.440
barely know each other!

372
17:46.200 --> 17:48.040
Some new shippers

373
17:48.080 --> 17:49.399
might think...

374
17:49.720 --> 17:51.200
Gu Yiliang and Wei Yanzi

375
17:51.280 --> 17:52.280
never interact on Weibo,

376
17:52.320 --> 17:53.400
so there's nothing to ship.

377
17:53.840 --> 17:54.680
Well, let me tell you,

378
17:54.760 --> 17:56.280
you couldn't be more wrong!

379
17:57.200 --> 17:58.200
Look here.

380
17:58.800 --> 17:59.720
Just watch.

381
17:59.721 --> 18:01.680
It'll leave you speechless.

382
18:01.800 --> 18:03.360
This round, I'll go by.

383
18:03.800 --> 18:04.600
Son of the Sea.

384
18:04.720 --> 18:05.760
Why?

385
18:07.000 --> 18:09.120
Because I was born in a coastal city.

386
18:09.200 --> 18:10.520
That very night,

387
18:10.960 --> 18:12.719
Gu Yiliang posted on Weibo,

388
18:12.720 --> 18:14.680
clearly responding to our Wei Yanzi.

389
18:14.960 --> 18:15.760
He said

390
18:15.960 --> 18:18.240
his favorite fairy tale was

391
18:18.560 --> 18:20.360
The Little Mermaid.

392
18:23.280 --> 18:24.440
Keep watching.

393
18:24.506 --> 18:25.226
William,

394
18:25.680 --> 18:27.080
how could you be so careless?

395
18:27.520 --> 18:28.680
I remember that day.

396
18:29.120 --> 18:30.560
I sprained my ankle on set.

397
18:30.640 --> 18:31.776
The second I posted about it,

398
18:31.800 --> 18:33.256
people accused me of buying trending topics.

399
18:33.280 --> 18:35.800
When Gu Yiliang's vlog came out that night,

400
18:36.080 --> 18:37.960
they said he was mocking his rival.

401
18:39.840 --> 18:41.160
But now...

402
18:41.200 --> 18:43.079
It's a subtle display of love!

403
18:43.080 --> 18:45.120
Exactly!

404
18:45.240 --> 18:46.520
Isn't it sweet?

405
18:46.640 --> 18:47.879
So sweet!

406
18:47.880 --> 18:49.439
Isn't he doting?

407
18:49.440 --> 18:51.200
So doting!

408
18:52.680 --> 18:53.800
Some people are alive,

409
18:54.160 --> 18:55.440
yet are already dead.

410
18:55.680 --> 18:56.960
Some people are dead,

411
18:57.160 --> 18:58.360
yet live on.

412
18:58.640 --> 19:00.560
Some people have never dated,

413
19:00.840 --> 19:02.200
yet they've been together

414
19:03.000 --> 19:04.280
for three years.

415
19:05.320 --> 19:06.880
In the Niangzi fans' eyes,

416
19:07.080 --> 19:08.240
Gu Yiliang and I

417
19:08.400 --> 19:10.359
aren't hiding knives behind smiles

418
19:10.360 --> 19:12.000
or silently provoking each other.

419
19:12.240 --> 19:14.319
Our eyes are full of tenderness,

420
19:14.320 --> 19:17.000
our love too deep for words.

421
19:18.360 --> 19:20.720
This is more than shipping.

422
19:21.760 --> 19:22.999
This is righteousness

423
19:23.000 --> 19:24.160
and great love.

424
19:24.200 --> 19:28.520
It's spreading goodness and beauty in the world.

425
19:31.120 --> 19:31.520
Oh, no!

426
19:31.600 --> 19:33.200
My ship content!

427
19:42.040 --> 19:43.040
Where are my earbuds?

428
19:43.360 --> 19:45.320
I can't lose them!

429
19:45.840 --> 19:47.880
They're essential shipping equipment!

430
19:48.280 --> 19:49.280
Wait.

431
19:52.360 --> 19:52.920
Thank you.

432
19:53.080 --> 19:53.320
Rival!

433
19:53.320 --> 19:53.880
No, no.

434
19:54.040 --> 19:55.040
Gu Yiliang.

435
19:55.440 --> 19:56.440
Mr. Gu.

436
19:56.720 --> 19:57.720
What a coincidence.

437
19:58.240 --> 19:59.240
Such a coincidence.

438
20:02.120 --> 20:03.360
Three days of work,

439
20:03.560 --> 20:04.920
and this is what you show me?

440
20:05.760 --> 20:06.760
I thought someone

441
20:06.920 --> 20:09.440
had handed in their kid's school project.

442
20:11.080 --> 20:12.880
Instead of making excuses,

443
20:13.160 --> 20:14.000
think about

444
20:14.120 --> 20:15.200
how to fix the problem.

445
20:17.560 --> 20:18.560
Cheng Yan.

446
20:19.480 --> 20:20.560
What a coincidence.

447
20:20.840 --> 20:21.880
Long time no see.

448
20:31.320 --> 20:32.320
Good morning.

449
20:32.640 --> 20:33.840
Slept well.

450
20:34.960 --> 20:35.480
Have you eaten?

451
20:35.680 --> 20:36.680
Quite full.

452
20:43.720 --> 20:44.920
Why'd it stop?

453
20:46.160 --> 20:47.640
It has been a long time.

454
20:48.480 --> 20:49.480
These past few years,

455
20:49.800 --> 20:52.240
I've hardly heard your name in the industry.

456
20:52.880 --> 20:54.040
I've changed my name.

457
20:54.360 --> 20:55.440
It's Lucas now.

458
20:56.160 --> 20:57.400
Never heard of him either.

459
20:59.200 --> 21:00.320
Be my sugar daddy.

460
21:10.800 --> 21:11.840
Zhu Mingming,

461
21:12.320 --> 21:13.440
did you come here today

462
21:13.720 --> 21:15.920
just to make jokes?

463
21:19.840 --> 21:23.440
I fought hard to land the villain role in "Lan Jue."

464
21:24.280 --> 21:25.960
But someone took it from me.

465
21:26.880 --> 21:28.000
So I was hoping...

466
21:28.280 --> 21:29.600
No.

467
21:38.680 --> 21:39.720
Cheng Yan,

468
21:40.400 --> 21:41.640
are you sure?

469
22:12.480 --> 22:13.480
Stop pressing it.

470
22:14.280 --> 22:14.840
Keep that up,

471
22:15.000 --> 22:17.040
and the elevator will think you're gaming with it.

472
22:18.000 --> 22:20.159
He said I'm gaming!

473
22:20.160 --> 22:23.319
In fanfic, he'd say, "Don't be scared. I'm here."

474
22:23.320 --> 22:24.599
If this keeps up,

475
22:24.600 --> 22:27.120
I'm unshipping us!

476
22:29.480 --> 22:30.480
Hello?

477
22:30.560 --> 22:32.000
Hello.

478
22:32.280 --> 22:33.160
We're trapped

479
22:33.161 --> 22:34.919
in the hotel's west elevator.

480
22:34.920 --> 22:36.280
Which floor?

481
22:36.800 --> 22:38.439
We're around...

482
22:38.440 --> 22:39.000
The eighth floor.

483
22:39.001 --> 22:40.360
Around the eighth floor.

484
22:40.680 --> 22:41.680
Please hold on.

485
22:41.681 --> 22:42.799
I'll send someone right away.

486
22:42.800 --> 22:44.120
Thank you.

487
23:25.680 --> 23:27.680
Mr... Mr. Gu.

488
23:28.080 --> 23:29.840
What are you doing?

489
23:34.760 --> 23:35.760
You.

490
23:46.360 --> 23:48.919
What the hell? This scene, this atmosphere...

491
23:48.920 --> 23:51.600
It's just like the fanfic I read last night!

492
23:57.520 --> 23:58.559
Why are you blushing?

493
23:58.560 --> 23:59.040
Huh?

494
23:59.480 --> 24:00.280
Am I?

495
24:00.480 --> 24:01.160
Well,

496
24:01.280 --> 24:02.680
it's stuffy and a little hot.

497
24:04.640 --> 24:07.040
I thought you were thinking something naughty.

498
24:07.080 --> 24:09.240
Gods above, someone save me!

499
24:09.600 --> 24:10.320
What does he mean?

500
24:10.321 --> 24:11.399
Is that a hint?

501
24:11.400 --> 24:12.560
No way.

502
24:13.360 --> 24:14.600
That look on your face

503
24:14.960 --> 24:16.800
is just like my cat

504
24:17.280 --> 24:18.760
when I catch it stealing canned food.

505
24:21.280 --> 24:22.880
You have a cat, Mr. Gu?

506
24:23.560 --> 24:24.760
Just one.

507
24:24.840 --> 24:25.840
It's adorable.

508
24:26.480 --> 24:27.920
Whenever it does something wrong,

509
24:28.200 --> 24:29.840
it acts like nothing happened,

510
24:30.200 --> 24:31.520
with its ears drooping.

511
24:38.080 --> 24:39.120
Does it eat well?

512
24:40.800 --> 24:41.800
Plenty of sleep.

513
24:59.040 --> 25:00.280
Sorry, Mr. Gu.

514
25:00.440 --> 25:02.080
I'm sorry. I didn't mean to.

515
25:02.160 --> 25:03.520
I lost my balance. Sorry.

516
25:09.920 --> 25:10.760
Help!

517
25:10.761 --> 25:11.919
I want to die.

518
25:11.920 --> 25:12.999
But if I actually die now,

519
25:13.000 --> 25:14.279
tomorrow's trending headline will be:

520
25:14.280 --> 25:16.039
Wei Yanzi and Gu Yiliang Die in Faulty Elevator.

521
25:16.040 --> 25:18.080
Their Intimate Final Pose Sparks Speculation.

522
25:18.840 --> 25:19.840
Come here.

523
25:21.960 --> 25:23.360
It's not safe over there.

524
25:23.560 --> 25:24.800
If the elevator suddenly moves,

525
25:25.160 --> 25:25.840
you could fall.

526
25:26.080 --> 25:26.800
Come stand with me.

527
25:26.920 --> 25:29.120
No, thanks. I'm fine.

528
25:36.880 --> 25:38.200
I'm safer here.

529
25:39.680 --> 25:40.920
Sure you are.

530
25:53.920 --> 25:56.080
Is he trembling?

531
26:02.560 --> 26:03.599
Would you like some...

532
26:03.600 --> 26:04.880
Wei!

533
26:05.160 --> 26:06.160
Wei!

534
26:06.200 --> 26:07.200
Bro!

535
26:11.160 --> 26:12.160
Mints?

536
26:14.080 --> 26:15.080
Wei,

537
26:15.400 --> 26:16.440
why is your face so red?

538
26:16.880 --> 26:17.640
Wei!

539
26:17.760 --> 26:18.800
Don't call me that!

540
26:20.000 --> 26:21.040
Thanks.

541
26:25.120 --> 26:25.680
Yiliang,

542
26:25.920 --> 26:28.000
the director asked about tonight's burial scene.

543
26:28.120 --> 26:30.040
Are you sure you don't want a double?

544
26:31.240 --> 26:32.240
I'm sure.

545
26:35.600 --> 26:36.600
Here.

546
26:38.280 --> 26:39.400
What's this?

547
26:40.000 --> 26:41.160
Why are you giving me this?

548
26:41.280 --> 26:42.360
Wei Yanzi gave it to me.

549
26:42.560 --> 26:44.799
He insisted I give it to you

550
26:44.800 --> 26:45.800
before the burial scene.

551
26:47.560 --> 26:48.800
What else did he say?

552
26:49.200 --> 26:50.120
He said

553
26:50.200 --> 26:51.360
it's for relieving stress.

554
26:51.400 --> 26:52.479
When you're nervous

555
26:52.480 --> 26:53.480
or scared,

556
26:53.640 --> 26:54.640
give it a squeeze.

557
27:00.320 --> 27:01.320
Yiliang,

558
27:02.520 --> 27:04.120
you don't think he's plotting something?

559
27:05.920 --> 27:07.319
Would you like some...

560
27:07.320 --> 27:08.320
Mints?

561
27:14.840 --> 27:15.840
No.

562
27:16.000 --> 27:17.200
Where's Wei Yanzi?

563
27:18.040 --> 27:19.480
He brought it himself just now.

564
27:19.640 --> 27:21.159
Then he said he had something urgent to do

565
27:21.160 --> 27:22.160
and left.

566
27:23.320 --> 27:25.000
Something urgent?

567
27:32.120 --> 27:33.959
Wow!

568
27:33.960 --> 27:35.839
Has the author been trapped in an elevator?

569
27:35.840 --> 27:37.600
This is so realistic!

570
27:38.840 --> 27:40.720
So many new fanfics!

571
27:43.640 --> 27:44.720
Award-winning actor top,

572
27:45.040 --> 27:46.320
pretty-boy bottom.

573
27:48.000 --> 27:49.000
A masterpiece!

574
27:49.080 --> 27:50.080
Look at this!

575
27:59.120 --> 28:01.679
The bloodshed is behind us,

576
28:01.680 --> 28:04.959
and my relationship with Gu Yiliang keeps improving.

577
28:04.960 --> 28:06.199
I've figured it out.

578
28:06.200 --> 28:07.999
People who ship couples

579
28:08.000 --> 28:10.040
can't be too unlucky.

580
28:10.866 --> 28:14.000
Gu Yiliang posted on Weibo!

581
28:15.680 --> 28:17.999
A new gift today.

582
28:18.000 --> 28:20.680
Just as "delicious" as the milk tea.

583
28:21.400 --> 28:22.440
This is different.

584
28:23.160 --> 28:25.560
This time, it's really different!

585
28:28.000 --> 28:29.720
Even if I die

586
28:29.920 --> 28:31.680
and get nailed inside a coffin,

587
28:31.920 --> 28:32.920
from inside my grave,

588
28:32.921 --> 28:35.040
with these rotting vocal cords, I'll cry:

589
28:35.120 --> 28:36.399
Niangzi

590
28:36.400 --> 28:39.760
is real!

591
28:43.880 --> 28:45.333
Bonus Content 1: Son of the Sea

592
28:45.720 --> 28:46.879
Let's welcome

593
28:46.880 --> 28:48.719
Mr. Wei Yanzi!

594
28:48.720 --> 28:50.199
Hello, everyone!

595
28:50.200 --> 28:51.560
It's been a while.

596
28:51.760 --> 28:52.240
Mr. Wei,

597
28:52.241 --> 28:53.759
in our last forest exploration round,

598
28:53.760 --> 28:55.400
your code name was Son of the Forest.

599
28:55.480 --> 28:56.999
For this new adventure round,

600
28:57.000 --> 28:58.800
what will your new code name be?

601
29:00.880 --> 29:01.880
Well,

602
29:01.960 --> 29:03.520
this round, I'll go by.

603
29:03.920 --> 29:04.720
Son of the Sea.

604
29:04.880 --> 29:05.880
Oh, why?

605
29:07.160 --> 29:09.440
Because I was born in a coastal city.

606
29:09.520 --> 29:11.720
I grew up eating seafood and breathing sea air.

607
29:11.920 --> 29:12.920
That's why I chose it.

608
29:12.920 --> 29:13.920
Wonderful.

609
29:13.921 --> 29:15.559
Before we begin, as always,

610
29:15.560 --> 29:17.120
how about showing us a talent?

611
29:17.360 --> 29:18.000
Well...

612
29:18.080 --> 29:19.480
Let me think.

613
29:20.520 --> 29:21.120
How about this?

614
29:21.240 --> 29:23.639
I recently learned a Russian tongue twister.

615
29:23.640 --> 29:24.919
Shall I give it a try?

616
29:24.920 --> 29:25.920
Excellent.

617
29:25.921 --> 29:27.040
The stage is yours.

618
29:27.240 --> 29:28.440
All right. Thank you.

619
29:29.000 --> 29:30.119
Is this spot okay?

620
29:30.120 --> 29:30.560
Yes.

621
29:30.560 --> 29:31.240
All right.

622
29:31.560 --> 29:32.000
Okay.

623
29:32.440 --> 29:33.440
Okay, I'm ready.

624
29:48.080 --> 29:49.199
Mr. Wei,

625
29:49.200 --> 29:50.480
sorry, could we do that again?

626
29:50.640 --> 29:51.920
We weren't recording.

627
29:52.240 --> 29:52.720
No problem.

628
29:52.800 --> 29:53.920
One more time.

629
30:02.560 --> 30:03.640
Son of the Sea.

630
30:06.680 --> 30:07.760
William, come here.

631
30:10.000 --> 30:10.880
William,

632
30:11.000 --> 30:12.760
how could you be so careless?
